  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reducing Food Insecurity through Cash Assistance to the Drought Affected Communities in Karamoja region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The CERF allocation will contribute to improved food security and resilience of these vulnerable households experiencing income loss. The action will contribute to increasing community resilience and limiting social and economic consequences of drought by providing ?Cash Assistance? to 5,000 vulnerable individuals including 2,700 women in five districts, Napak, Moroto, Abim, Kaabong and Kotido in Karamoja region.</narrative>
  </description>
